# Normalise to LF in the working tree, not just in the index.
#
# Prettier's `endOfLine` defaults to "lf" and the shared .prettierrc.json does not override it,
# so a file checked out as CRLF fails `npm run format:check` even though the blob in git is LF.
# With core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) that happened to every file touched by a pull,
# turning format:check red locally while CI stayed green on Linux. Pinning the working tree to
# LF makes the local and CI results identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

.husky/* text eol=lf
